WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.013 --> 00:00:08.115
Open Exchange Rate in Reports and choose a foreign-currency entry

2
00:00:08.115 --> 00:00:22.445
Enter the rate in either direction. The other rate and converted amount update together

3
00:00:22.445 --> 00:00:31.663
The next entry starts with the most recent rate for these currencies. Check it and save

4
00:00:31.663 --> 00:01:06.000
When the card's final charge is known, enter that amount directly

5
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Reports now uses the saved final charge and rate

6
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:28.433
Choose how rates are shown in More → Exchange Rate Display
